study_space","entity_name":"STEM Hall Atrium","title":"Work at the STEM Hall Atrium","subtitle":"Daylit collaborative tables with writable surfaces nearby","notes":"Bring a group problem set, use the shared tables and writable Walltalker surfaces, and carry your student card if working during evening access.","short_summary":"A bright science-building atrium designed around collaborative work, device use, and writable surfaces.","evidence_claim":"Grove City College documents an atrium lounge, common study spaces, shared-display workstations, and writable Walltalker surfaces in STEM Hall.","source_url":"https://www.gcc.edu/Home/Experience-the-Grove/Facilities/STEM-Hall","source_title":"STEM Hall","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://my.gcc.edu/m/d/m/c0cc99ee-f9d3-4bdf-8f64-39779bdaa513/CampusMap/Index","access_notes":"Open Monday–Friday 7:30 a.m.–6 p.m., except school holidays. Student-card access runs Monday–Thursday 6–11 p.m. and Sunday 7–11 p.m.; Sunday entry is through the doors facing Breen Student Union.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gcc-hoyt-hall-lobby-study-space","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Hoyt Hall Lobby-Study Space","title":"Sketch Problems in Hoyt Hall","subtitle":"Engineering lobby tables with dry-erase boards","notes":"Use the tables and dry-erase boards to diagram a problem with classmates, then confirm building access locally before planning an evening session.","short_summary":"A first-floor engineering workspace built around tables, whiteboards, and collaborative problem-solving.","evidence_claim":"Grove City College describes Hoyt Hall’s first-floor lobby-study space as having modern tables, chairs, dry-erase boards, and a video monitor for collaborative work.","source_url":"https://www.gcc.edu/Home/Staff-Directory/Staff-Detail/engineering-aesthetics-hoyt-hall-gets-a-makeover","source_title":"Engineering aesthetics: Hoyt Hall gets a makeover","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://my.gcc.edu/m/d/m/c0cc99ee-f9d3-4bdf-8f64-39779bdaa513/CampusMap/Index","access_notes":"Located in Hoyt Hall’s first-floor lobby. The supporting page does not publish current building hours or reservation requirements; verify access on campus before visiting.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gcc-hamilton-curriculum-library","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Hamilton Curriculum Library","title":"Build a Lesson in Hamilton Library","subtitle":"Collaborative curriculum workspace inside Staley Hall","notes":"Bring a lesson-planning task and use the curated curriculum collection with classmates; confirm service availability with Education staff when needed.","short_summary":"A specialized collaborative library for education majors working with curriculum and lesson-planning materials.","evidence_claim":"Grove City College calls Hamilton Curriculum Library a collaborative hub for education majors to work together on effective lesson planning.","source_url":"https://www.gcc.edu/Home/Academics/Majors-Departments/Education","source_title":"Education Department | Grove City College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://my.gcc.edu/m/d/m/c0cc99ee-f9d3-4bdf-8f64-39779bdaa513/CampusMap/Index","access_notes":"Located in Staley Hall. The College does not publish separate public hours for the curriculum library; follow Staley Hall access hours and confirm staffed services with the Education Department.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gcc-breen-student-union-study-area","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Breen Student Union","title":"Use Breen for an All-Hours Session","subtitle":"Lounging and study space in the campus student union","notes":"Choose Breen when you need a flexible communal setting, use a lounge or meeting area, and expect nearby dining, events, and conversation.","short_summary":"A round-the-clock, in-session student-union setting for study that does not require library-level quiet.","evidence_claim":"Grove City College says Breen Student Union contains lounges and meeting places and provides spaces for lounging and studying.","source_url":"https://www.gcc.edu/Home/Experience-the-Grove/Facilities/Breen-Student-Union","source_title":"Breen Student Union","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://my.gcc.edu/m/d/m/c0cc99ee-f9d3-4bdf-8f64-39779bdaa513/CampusMap/Index","access_notes":"Open 24 hours a day, seven days a week while classes are in session. It is a social student-union environment, so plan quiet or concentration-intensive work elsewhere.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Published access hours can change for holidays, academic breaks, and special events; verify same-day notices before relying on evening or weekend access.","The College’s public sources do not provide separately verified coordinates for interior rooms, so card coordinates are null."]}],"warnings":[]}
